    "heading": "Level 15: Improved Elemental Fury",
    "lineStart": 2916,
    "lineEnd": 2922
  },
  "section": "3.92",
  "rulesText": "The option you chose for Elemental Fury grows more powerful, as detailed below.\n\nPotent Spellcasting. When you cast a Druid can-trip with a range of 10 feet or greater, the spell's range increases by 300 feet.\n\nPrimal Strike. The extra damage of your Primal Strike increases to 2d8."
}
